# Line endings live in the repository, not in each clone's core.autocrlf: a Windows clone with autocrlf=true
# would otherwise check every text file out with CRLF and biome (lineEnding lf) would fail on all of them.
# Text is LF in the index and in the working tree on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Real binaries: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wasm binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
